// General Guidelines for Managing Complexity  
// 1. Break Down Large Methods: Use helper methods to break down functionality into smaller, reusable components. Aim for each method to handle a single responsibility.  
// 2. Use Design Patterns: Apply appropriate design patterns to handle complex logic elegantly.  
