          <Query Active="True" Locked="True" DisplayList="True" DisplayStat="True" DisplaySelectionView="False" IsCriticalRule="False"><![CDATA[//<Name>MISRA 4-6-1: Operations on a memory location shall be sequenced appropriately</Name>
