          <Query Active="True" Locked="True" DisplayList="True" DisplayStat="True" DisplaySelectionView="False" IsCriticalRule="False"><![CDATA[//<Name>MISRA 5-10-1 User-defined identifiers shall have an appropriate form.</Name>
