          <Query Active="True" Locked="True" DisplayList="True" DisplayStat="True" DisplaySelectionView="False" IsCriticalRule="False"><![CDATA[//<Name>MISRA 5-13-1 Within character literals and non raw-string literals, \ shall only be used to form a defined escape sequence or universal character name</Name>
