          <Query Active="True" Locked="True" DisplayList="True" DisplayStat="True" DisplaySelectionView="False" IsCriticalRule="False"><![CDATA[//<Name>MISRA 6-5-1 A function or object with external linkage should be introduced in a header file</Name>
