          <Query Active="True" Locked="True" DisplayList="True" DisplayStat="True" DisplaySelectionView="False" IsCriticalRule="False"><![CDATA[//<Name>MISRA 6-8-1 An object shall not be accessed outside of its lifetime</Name>
