          <Query Active="True" Locked="True" DisplayList="True" DisplayStat="True" DisplaySelectionView="False" IsCriticalRule="False"><![CDATA[//<Name>MISRA 6-8-2 A function must not return a reference or a pointer to a local variable with automatic storage duration</Name>
